    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「Lasso 回归」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "随着数据维度增加，分析者需要既能避免过拟合、又能识别有用变量的模型。岭回归能收缩系数，但通常不会把它们变成零。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-regression-shrinkage-and-selection-via-the-lasso"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Lasso 在回归中加入 L1 惩罚。该惩罚的几何形状自然产生精确零系数，因此预测与选择被绑定在一起。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-regression-shrinkage-and-selection-via-the-lasso"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 Lasso 视为稀疏、可解释线性建模的标准工具。它的长期影响在于由正则化驱动的特征选择，尤其影响高维统计、基因组学和透明预测建模。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-regression-shrinkage-and-selection-via-the-lasso"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「Lasso 回归」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-scikit-learn-lasso",
